  dialogue:
    name: 'Silas:'
    sentences:
    - "My life\u2019s dedication, gone in an instant. All of it is too much to bear\u2026\r\r"
    - "\rMaybe my liege should have put me out of my misery.\r"
    - Maybe I can do what he should have done.
